{
  "description": "E5 anaphora/ellipsis eval set (Campaign E, Step 2 gate). 30 follow-up items with a known referent + 12 self-contained no-harm controls. EN + NL, Latin-script (project scope). Items with an `edges` block are seeded into a temp store so the CANONICAL-entity resolution path is exercised; items without one exercise the salient-token fallback (a fresh session with no graph yet — exactly when follow-ups are most likely). `expect` lists acceptable referents: an item counts as RESOLVED when the rewrite fired AND at least one of them appears in the rewritten query. Controls must produce NO rewrite. Written 2026-07-30 as a hand-built set; nothing here reads any benchmark's gold labels.",
